= Liquidity pool — Technical =

An AMM pool state can be represented by a reserve vector x. Deposits, withdrawals, swaps, fees, and protocol actions update x subject to the mechanism's admissibility rules. Effective depth and LP exposure depend on the invariant, fee schedule, range structure, asset behavior, and external arbitrage.

== Modeling / security cautions ==
* liquidity pool ≠ AMM
* pool share ≠ guaranteed principal value
* pooled liquidity ≠ unlimited market depth

